<title>UK: IMS Group to seek London Stock Exchange listing.</title>
<headline>IMS Group to seek London Stock Exchange listing.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK telephone services provider IMS Group Plc said on Friday that it plans to seek a listing on London Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The Leeds-based company said the placing, to be sponsored by Hambros, would be worth between 24.0 million stg and 27.0 million stg. It will raise 15.0 million stg, which will go to repay debts and fund product development and acquisitions.</p>
<p>IMS provides sports and other information by telephone. It also offers telephone services to regional newspapers, television companies and other business customers.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7945</p>
